OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Grenfell housing chief no
OL,4,Alonger at Barnet Council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Grenfell Tower housing chief
OL,7,Fwho was appointed as a group director
OL,8,Fat Barnet Homes last month, is no
OL,9,Flonger in her role.
OL,11,FLaura Johnson led the housing
OL,12,Fdepartment at the Royal Borough of
OL,13,FKensington and Chelsea (RBKC) when the
OL,14,FGrenfell Tower fire killed 72 people in
OL,15,FJune 2017 and later gave evidence to
OL,16,Fthe public inquiry.
OL,18,FBereaved families and survivors of the
OL,19,Ftragedy had condemned her appointment
OL,20,Fto the council-owned company and called
OL,21,Fit "a scandal".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
