OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Grenfell housing chief no
OL,4,Alonger at Barnet Council
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnet Homes said it was inappropriate
OL,7,Fto comment but confirmed she "is no
OL,8,Flonger employed by The Barnet Group".
OL,9,FThe BBC has approached Johnson for
OL,10,Ffurther comment through Barnet Council.
